#: data/kde32b1.khotkeys:610
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"After pressing Alt+Ctrl+H the input of 'Hello' will be simulated, as if you "
"typed it.  This is especially useful if you have call to frequently type a "
"word (for instance, 'unsigned').  Every keypress in the input is separated "
"by a colon ':'. Note that the keypresses literally mean keypresses, so you "
"have to write what you would press on the keyboard. In the table below, the "
"left column shows the input and the right column shows what to type.\\n\\n"
"\"enter\" (i.e. new line)                Enter or Return\\na (i.e. small "
"a)                          A\\nA (i.e. capital a)                       "
"Shift+A\\n: (colon)                                  Shift+;\\n' "
"'  (space)                              Space"
msgstr ""
"Après aveur tchôkî Alt+Ctrl+H, l' intrêye « Bondjoû » serè forveyowe, come "
"si vs l' avîz tapé vos-ôtes minme. C' est especiålmint ehessåve si vs duvoz "
"sovint taper on mot (metans « nén-siné ». Tchaeke tchôcaedje di tape e "
"l' intrêye est metou a pårt pa ene colone « : ». Sepoz k' les tchôcaedjes di "
"tape volèt vraiymint dire des tchôcaedjes di tape, d' abôrd vos dvoz scrire "
"çou k' vos schirrîz sol taprece. Dins l' tåvlea vaici pa dzo, l' colone di "
"hintche mostere l' intrêye eyet l' colone di droete mostere çou k' vos tapez."
"\\n\\n« intrêye » (c' est ene novele roye)                Intrêye ou Ritoû"
"\\na (c' est on ptit a)                          A\\nA (c' est on grand "
"a)                       Maj+A\\n: (colone)                                  "
"Maj+;\\n«   »  (espåce)                              Espåce"

#: data/kde32b1.khotkeys:673
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Type 'Hello'"
msgstr "Tapez « Bondjoû »"

